Third-party runtime components
------------------------------

The production bundle ships no third-party runtime dependencies. Everything in
the "devDependencies" field of package.json is a build tool, a type checker, or
a test tool, and is not redistributed in the built output. Their licenses are
listed by `npx license-checker --production` or in each package's own LICENSE
file under node_modules/.
